{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VMJCE29cS7459gPNmMyf3d","type":"tool_result","content":"1\timport Mathlib\n2\t\n3\topen Real Set Nat\n4\t\n5\tnoncomputable abbrev putnam_2016_b4_solution : ℕ → ℝ := (fun n : ℕ => (2 * n)! / (4 ^ n * (n)!))\n6\t/--\n7\tLet $A$ be a $2n \\times 2n$ matrix, with entries chosen independently at random. Every entry is chosen to be $0$ or $1$, each with probability $1/2$. Find the expected value of $\\det(A-A^t)$ (as a function of $n$), where $A^t$ is the transpose of $A$.\n8\t-/\n9\ttheorem putnam_2016_b4\n10\t  (n : ℕ) (npos : n ≥ 1)\n11\t  (mats01 : Set (Matrix (Fin (2 * n)) (Fin (2 * n)) ℝ))\n12\t  (hmats01 : mats01 = {A | ∀ i j : Fin (2 * n), A i j = 0 ∨ A i j = 1}) :\n13\t  (∑' A : mats01, (A.1 - (Matrix.transpose A)).det) / mats01.ncard = putnam_2016_b4_solution n :=\n14\tsorry\n15\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"32a2d942-e5cc-42bb-8394-3e789624766f","uuid":"f1f76644-b2ab-4d01-96cd-ba2c3e531022","timestamp":"2026-10-14T02:05:02.651Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/work/putnam_2016_b4.lean","content":"import Mathlib\n\nopen Real Set Nat\n\nnoncomputable abbrev putnam_2016_b4_solution : ℕ → ℝ := (fun n : ℕ => (2 * n)! / (4 ^ n * (n)!))\n/--\nLet $A$ be a $2n \\times 2n$ matrix, with entries chosen independently at random. Every entry is chosen to be $0$ or $1$, each with probability $1/2$. Find the expected value of $\\det(A-A^t)$ (as a function of $n$), where $A^t$ is the transpose of $A$.\n-/\ntheorem putnam_2016_b4\n  (n : ℕ) (npos : n ≥ 1)\n  (mats01 : Set (Matrix (Fin (2 * n)) (Fin (2 * n)) ℝ))\n  (hmats01 : mats01 = {A | ∀ i j : Fin (2 * n), A i j = 0 ∨ A i j = 1}) :\n  (∑' A : mats01, (A.1 - (Matrix.transpose A)).det) / mats01.ncard = putnam_2016_b4_solution n :=\nsorry\n","numLines":15,"startLine":1,"totalLines":15}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01VMJCE29cS7459gPNmMyf3d","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type"